OL,9,     GMichelle's Mood is... CHER! Non-
OL,10,     Gstop Cher-fire smashes to
OL,11,     Gcelebrate her 80th birthday.
OL,12,G2100FSophie Ellis-Bextor's Kitchen
OL,13,     FDisco
OL,14,     GGet ready for the sounds, colour,
OL,15,     Gexcitement and sheer energy of
OL,16,     GSophie's annual Eurovision Disco
OL,17,     Gspecial! Expect a ton of Europop,
OL,18,     Gplus loads of previous winners
OL,19,     Gand near misses.
